<title>BELGIUM: BELGIAN BEMAT H1 96 PRE-TAX PROFIT UP 58%.</title>
<headline>BELGIAN BEMAT H1 96 PRE-TAX PROFIT UP 58%.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons turnover/sales	    222.2   vs  220.9</p>
<p>    Cons operating profit	   19.0   vs    6.3</p>
<p>    Cons financial profit	    5.7   vs    9.4</p>
<p>    Cons pre-tax profit	     25.0   vs   15.8</p>
<p>    Cons pre-tax profit per share    616 vs	391</p>
<p>NOTE - Belgian construction group Bemat SA said its order</p>
<p>book was worth 440 million francs at August 1, up from 400</p>
<p>million on July 31, 1995. The company said 1996 dividend should</p>
<p>be at least equal to 1995's 588 franc gross dividend.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
